==Strategy==
It's recommended to use 3-4 meatshields, and stall for a high level Wallet as well as other Special Cats you might have, like [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]].
Then, spam Dark crowd-control units such as [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]] and any other anti-Dark ubers you might have available. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat/Pizza Cat]] is exceptionally useful for this stage, as are [[Wave Shield|Wave Blockers]] like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] if you happen to own them.

